  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7002.30 Subaddress",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7002.30 “Subaddress” means the part of a physical address such as apartment, unit or building designation that uniquely identifies a structure when multiple structures are sharing one address number or each unit inside the structure.\n\nSource. #11128, eff 6-29-16",
